      "id": "def-the-whittaker-functor-from-the-relevant-parabolic-o-summand",
      "statement": "For a U(m)-finitely-generated object N of genuine parabolic O, V(N) := Hom_m(N,C_χ)*. The stated interface gives exactness, coherent tensor/Casimir/flip compatibility, V(P_c)=C_c, V(T)=V_c^⊗d, and simple images precisely on standard labels, under admissible origins.",
