    },
    {
      "id": "thm-the-whittaker-functor-is-exact-and-fully-faithful-on-the-required-projectives",
      "statement": "Assume AC and admissible c. V is exact on O_c^d; the natural comparison Hom_g(T,−) → Hom_W(V_c^⊗d,V(−)) is an isomorphism. Both functors are fully faithful on all projectives, and the Hecke quotient is fully faithful on tiltings. T is a prinjective detector and need not generate the entire summand.",
      "used_by": [
