      "id": "lem-type-a-nilpotent-orbit-closures-are-normal-via-chain-varieties",
      "statement": "Assume AC. For every nilpotent endomorphism e of a finite-dimensional complex V, the coordinate ring of its conjugacy-orbit closure is a reduced irreducible normal domain, and the orbit boundary has codimension at least two.",
