      "statement": "The doubled pyramid grading gives the polynomial transverse product and gr^K W=C[S]. Assuming AC, Q_χ⊗_W X has twisted m-cohomology X in degree zero and zero in positive degrees for every W-module X. Locally nilpotent shifted m-actions detect nonzero modules by simultaneous invariants.",
