      "statement": "For l≥1 and d≥1, H_d(a)=H_d/(∏_j(x_1−a_j)); H_0(a)=C. Its bounded monomials x_1^r_1⋯x_d^r_d w, 0≤r_i<l, form a basis, its dimension is l^d d!, and its top-coefficient functional is a nondegenerate symmetric trace.",
      "used_by": [
