      "id": "thm-the-finite-w-and-degenerate-cyclotomic-hecke-actions-satisfy-double-centralizer",
      "statement": "Assume AC. The finite-W and cyclotomic Hecke image algebras are mutual centralizers for every complex origin and degree. For a nonempty pyramid, q_l≥d gives full cyclotomic faithfulness. Admissible origins give the tensor progenerator and Morita equivalence.",
      "used_by": [
